Not scoring. This is the 8B evidence dossier only.

The core 2022 program is clear from the record: socio-economic recovery and macro stability, 2045-oriented modernization, and a stronger anti-corruption / Party-discipline drive. The evidence below separates that program from implementation, outcomes, and side effects.

